{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261104/photo/bkn-20261104074215069-1104_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261104082151\"/><p>商場玻璃門被紅油沾污。</p><p>將軍澳發生淋油追債事件。今日(4日)零時47分，景嶺路8號一商場保安員報案，指商場內有牆身及玻璃門被人淋潑紅油，地上遺下寫有懷疑欠債人姓名、住址及身份證號碼的字條。警員接報到場調查、翻查閉路電視片段，並聯絡字條上所示的人士了解事件。案件列「刑事毀壞」處理，正追緝涉案歹徒。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T00:44:44.960707+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":156,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T23:42:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T10:35:14.598776+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T00:38:31.768217+00:00","content_hash":"04b82e1f2b0377475936390991d939f2ab5c7e63d5c3fb4e5b2719af02d2da85","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-04T00:44:44.960707+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}